# The Hidden Veins (Q293): a dwarven fighter of level 6 accepts at Filaur. Chinchirin cannot make a
# map from no fragment. Ten Utuku orcs give ten chrysolite ores (roll pinned to 51, over 50), four more
# four torn map fragments (roll 0, under 5) and one nothing (roll 20); Chinchirin makes a hidden vein
# map from the four fragments. Filaur pays 5 per ore, 500 per map and 2000 more for ten ores, and, the
# first time only, 6000 beginner soulshots with the tutorial voice. One more ore is paid alone, without
# shots; four more fragments give a second map, paid alone; then the player quits the repeatable
# quest; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q293_the_hidden_veins.golden
character Veins 6
class 53
random 51 0 51 0 51 0 51 0 51 0 51 0 51 0 51 0 51 0 51 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 20 51 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
script quest.Q293_TheHiddenVeins
item 1488 1489 1490 5789
page default/30535.htm
page default/30539.htm
page script/quest/Q293_TheHiddenVeins/
npc filaur 30535 Folk 10 0 0
npc chinchirin 30539 Folk -10 0 0
npc orc 20446 Monster 40 0 0

# Filaur: accept.
action filaur
action filaur
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=filaur item=0 page=default/30535.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{filaur}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=filaur item=0 page=script/quest/Q293_TheHiddenVeins/30535-02.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
